# Compile output all lands in build/ (see Makefile -output-directory)
build/
# macOS + tool cruft
.DS_Store
.cache/
missfont.log
# The one tracked PDF at the src root is dissertacao.pdf (the current defense build);
# everything else PDF-shaped is build output.
# LaTeX residue at the source root: pdflatex -output-directory writes into build/, but
# BibTeX resolves chapters/*.aux RELATIVE TO THE SOURCE DIR. A stale copy here therefore
# shadows build/ and can feed BibTeX an outdated citation key (this happened 2026-07-26:
# four undefined citations shipped in both PDFs from July-25 aux files). Never commit these.
*.aux
chapters/*.aux
main.bbl
main.blg
main.log
main.toc
main.lof
main.lot
